  "description": "Non-cryptographic hashing and integrity primitives for .NET: Fletcher-16/32/64, the full RevEng CRC catalogue, and check-digit algorithms (Luhn, Damm, Verhoeff, EAN/UPC/GTIN, ISBN, IBAN, ISIN, LEI, ISO 7064, ...). These are for data integrity and validation, NOT security — do not use them where a cryptographic hash or MAC is required.",
